# Book manuscripts, plans and source audits. LOCAL ONLY - do not commit.
#
# Decided 2026-10-03 for the tinnitus book: the manuscript stays on disk and
# is not published here. This repo is public and a finished manuscript is a
# paid product; the machinery, the docs and the build recipe are the
# shareable parts, the book is not.
#
# If a book's text is ever published it will be on its own site, not in this
# repo. Note that doing so is a publishing decision in its own right: the
# site repo is also public and a push to its main branch is a production
# deploy. Never make that call on the author's behalf.
projects/*/book/
